OL,3,CEverton FC 'put up for sale'
OL,5,FEverton FC has been 'put up for sale'
OL,6,Fas owners The Friedkin Group say it is
OL,7,Fexploring new investment opportunities.
OL,9,FThe American owner says it is open to
OL,10,Fthe "potential sale of a controlling
OL,11,Finterest" but added it will only
OL,12,Fconsider bids from "parties who we
OL,13,Fstrongly believe will be the right
OL,14,Fstewards to take the Club forward".
OL,16,FThe Friedkin Group (TFG) bought
OL,17,FEverton through its UK investment
OL,18,Fvehicle Roundhouse Capital in December
OL,19,F2024, purchasing Farhad Moshiri's 94%
OL,20,Fstake.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
