OL,3,CEverton FC 'put up for sale'
OL,5,FThey later oversaw the move from
OL,6,FGoodison Park to the new Hill
OL,7,FDickinson Stadium.
OL,9,FIn a statement, the owners said: "The
OL,10,FFriedkin Group is exploring new
OL,11,Finvestment options for Everton
OL,12,FFootball Club, including the potential
OL,13,Fsale of a controlling interest.
OL,15,F"When TFG became custodians of
OL,16,FEverton, the Club faced significant
OL,17,Ffinancial uncertainty and challenges
OL,18,Fboth on and off the pitch.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791541106
OL,3,CEverton FC 'put up for sale'
OL,5,F"The immediate priority was to provide
OL,6,Fthe stability, investment and support
OL,7,Fneeded to secure the Club's future,
OL,8,Fincluding helping to bring the long-
OL,9,Fpromised stadium to completion for its
OL,10,Fdeserving supporters.
OL,12,F"With that foundation now safely in
OL,13,Fplace, the time is right to consider
OL,14,Fthe next chapter for Everton. We will
OL,15,Fonly entertain interest from parties
OL,16,Fwho we strongly believe will be the
OL,17,Fright stewards to take the Club
OL,18,Fforward and build on the momentum that
OL,19,Fhas been established.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791541106
OL,3,CEverton FC 'put up for sale'
OL,5,F"Throughout this process, TFG's focus
OL,6,Fwill remain unchanged. We will support
OL,7,Fthe Club in all ways necessary to
OL,8,Fachieve success on the pitch and will
OL,9,Fcontinue efforts to make a positive
OL,10,Fdifference in the communities the Club
OL,11,Fserves.
OL,13,F"TFG and the Club will not be
OL,14,Fcommenting further while this work is
OL,15,Funder way."
OL,17,FWho is the man putting Everton up for
OL,18,Fsale?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
