OL,3,CEverton FC 'put up for sale'
OL,5,FDan Friedkin is a businessman and film
OL,6,Fproducer from America who has an
OL,7,Festimated net worth of $6.1billion
OL,8,F(#4.9billion).
OL,10,FThe 59-year-old accumulated the
OL,11,Fmajority of his fortune from his
OL,12,Fownership of the car dealership
OL,13,Fcompany Gulf States Toyota, which he
OL,14,Finherited at 35 years old from his
OL,15,Ffather as well as TFG.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
